{"id": "DfJaEFrx_zS", "title": "Video by astro_zova", "description": "रावण स्वर्ग गया या नरक? 🤔\n\nजवाब है: दोनों में से कोई नहीं! 😳\nरावण असल में था जय, भगवान विष्णु का अपना द्वारपाल।\nएक श्राप… तीन जन्म… और हर जन्म में मुक्ति भगवान के हाथों। 🙏\n\n1️⃣ हिरण्याक्ष–हिरण्यकशिपु\n2️⃣ रावण–कुंभकर्ण\n3️⃣ शिशुपाल–दंतवक्र\n\nऔर फिर… वापसी वैकुंठ में। ✨\n\n💬 क्या आप ये जानते थे? कमेंट में लिखिए \"जय श्री राम\"\n📌 Save करें, दोस्तों को भेजें\n\n🔮 अपनी दैनिक कुंडली देखें: zovaastro.in\n\n#ravan #ravana #ramayan #jaishriram #jayvijay #vishnu #vaikuntha #hindumythology #sanatandharma #mythologystories #shriram #reelsindia #bhaktireels", "channel": "astro_zova", "uploader_id": "29969741716", "uploader": "Zova Astro", "timestamp": 1793424602, "like_count": 2734, "comment_count": 5, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/145.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1666238661845805a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 77.785, "asr": 96000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQMWGhj5TEp6tuYghuOVze38fiBnsvhxaTB_1PROGoEkJpv9KM7kV0uicbG-kYjtyKAfqQ5-dIWXdfEPchjx_LVlhldlD-1IR1w2EDk.mp4?_nc_cat=106&_nc_oc=Adq-uIhgfn2_vp--iPCaxm9GxEoMLrswiR8fliZMosJBIbVFWOaF3gg6snh0pMP0ijcoZ_0sE2ylRx3uvcgapbtQ&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=Fqs-cPSh4nwQ7kNvwGfNHpn&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=ljvo9dwHkEdmhafTKUb6kQ&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQQn6JWq1fWidGUo5MmdLDeN3tH73xbi7zbSDUnw4xJ19w&oe=6AF43E1B", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 77.785, "resolution": "audio only", "